    {
      "bbox": [
        243,
        1044,
        740,
        1089
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "My dear Commissioner:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2794,
          "min": -1.4323
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0052,
          "min": -0.0052
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 4,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0007
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2017,
        "area_px": 19845,
        "density": 0.10164,
        "chars": 21,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.41
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        243,
        1137,
        1958,
        1320
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Municipal Management Program, being conducted by the Division of Analysis and the departmental analysis units, is now an established part of our day to day operations. The results thus far achieved are most gratifying.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.277,
          "min": -1.5883
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0051,
          "min": -0.2023
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13892,
        "area_px": 304695,
        "density": 0.04559,
        "chars": 222,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.98
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        243,
        1366,
        1895,
        1549
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to attain the ultimate goal to which this program is directed, it is essential that those engaged in this work be kept continually aware of latest developments and techniques. This can best be accomplished by regular training programs.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2287,
          "min": -1.4784
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0077
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16840,
        "area_px": 293166,
        "density": 0.05744,
        "chars": 244,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.49
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        240,
        1592,
        1920,
        1818
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have, therefore, made arrangements with the City College for the conduct of courses to be open, at this time, only to those city employees engaged in the Management Program. It would include those in the Division of Analysis of the Bureau of the Budget and in the various departmental analysis units.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2553,
          "min": -1.375
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 59,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0244
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 18613,
        "area_px": 367702,
        "density": 0.05062,
        "chars": 302,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.23
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        240,
        1867,
        1920,
        2045
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "These courses will be provided by City College without cost to those attending. The college will grant certificates upon successful completion. The details of the training program are set forth in the attached circular.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2021,
          "min": -1.3757
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0049,
          "min": -0.1799
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14837,
        "area_px": 289606,
        "density": 0.05123,
        "chars": 219,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        236,
        2095,
        1966,
        2413
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Since the advanced management training to be covered in these courses will be of immeasurable assistance to all within your analysis unit, I would urge that you encourage them to participate. Please submit to Mr. Abraham D. Beame, Assistant Director of the Budget, not later than September 28th, the names of those who will attend. Arrangements should also be made for these persons to be excused in sufficient time for them to attend the scheduled sessions.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2658,
          "min": -1.4309
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 94,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.062
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 32077,
        "area_px": 532014,
        "density": 0.06029,
        "chars": 458,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.28
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        532,
        2460,
        1740,
        2504
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I know I can count on your cooperation in this matter.",
